"context_title": "INTERIOR: PIATA INN",
"description": "A cozy inn near the Academy. A full rest restores your party to peak condition before the next expedition.",
"dialogue": "You look exhausted, hunter. A good night's rest will do you wonders. Shall I prepare a room?",
